<title>USA: Irwin Financial cites loan gain for Q4 net.</title>
<headline>Irwin Financial cites loan gain for Q4 net.</headline>
<dateline>COLUMBUS, Ind. 1997-01-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Irwin Financial Corp said Friday performance improvements at its home equity subsidiary helped net income rise by more than 28 percent in the fourth quarter of 1996.</p>
<p>The company reported net income of $6.9 million, or $0.59 a share, compared with $5.3 million, or $0.46 a share, one year ago. Revenues in the period reached $53.8 million, versus $43.5 million in the fourth quarter last year.</p>
<p>Irwin Financial is a financial services holding company.</p>
<p>Its shares were trading up 1/4 Friday at 28-1/4.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk (312) 408-8787))</p>
